[TITLE]
API-08: 1 cfs of clean dry-weather flow at J1 -> C1 -> O1, pollutant P1 in mg/L.
A mass inflow of 10 mg/s of P1 at J1 is given in [INFLOWS] (type MASS).

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             02:00:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         30
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name Elev MaxDepth InitDepth SurDepth Aponded
J1     10   5   0   0   0

[OUTFALLS]
O1   5   FREE

[CONDUITS]
C1  J1  O1  400  0.013  0  0  1.0

[XSECTIONS]
C1  CIRCULAR  1.5  0  0  0  1

[POLLUTANTS]
;;Name Units Crain Cgw Crdii Kdecay SnowOnly CoPollut CoFrac Cdwf Cinit
P1  MG/L  0  0  0  0  NO  *  0  0  0

[DWF]
J1  FLOW  1.0

[INFLOWS]
;;Node Constituent Tseries Type Mfactor Sfactor Baseline
J1    P1          ""      MASS 1.0     1.0     10
